exit: 0
command: restart
description: "Changes the miner: the miner restarts and stops hashing until it is up again; without --confirm sends no request and prints the host, the request, the effect and the command that performs it; with --confirm sends exactly one POST /api/system/restart, with no read before or after it; HTTP 200 is success; any other outcome is an error that states whether the request was sent"
flags:
  host: "--host <address>; without it AXEOS_HOST, then the saved host (axeos-axi host --help), and the result then prints saved_host; one of the three is required; one miner; HTTP unless a scheme is supplied"
  confirm: "--confirm; sends the restart request; default sends no request"
  json: "--json; prints the result as one JSON document with the same fields, values and help lines; errors as one JSON object with code, message and help; the exit code is unchanged"
  help: "--help; no network request"
  version: "-v, -V, --version; bare version, or with --json one object {\"version\":\"...\"}; no network request"
timeout_s: 4
examples[3]: axeos-axi restart --host 192.0.2.10,axeos-axi restart --host 192.0.2.10 --confirm,axeos-axi restart --help
